AOSP community testkey (libs/signing/)

This repository ships the well-known Android Open Source Project (AOSP)
"community" / testkey commonly trusted on unlocked / userdebug AAOS head
units. The private key material is already public as the standard AOSP
community testkey; it is included here so clones build and resign without
an extra download step.

  Files: libs/signing/community.pk8, libs/signing/community.pem
  Fingerprint historically noted as: d7f1f224
  Subject: AOSP Android CN test certificate

This is NOT an OEM platform signing key (for example Geely / Antora
platform signature 3075720b). It does not grant signature|privileged
permissions by itself; see docs/safety.md.

Intended use: resign APKs for install on userdebug / remountable HUs that
already trust this community key. Do not use it to sign software for
distribution to end users as a unique identity.

